1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,966
Then the endodermis.

2
00:00:01,966 --> 00:00:10,625
Each of its cells wears a band of lignin, later joined by suberin, in its radial walls: the Casparian strip.

3
00:00:10,625 --> 00:00:12,578
The wall route is blocked.

4
00:00:12,578 --> 00:00:21,328
Every drop and every ion must now pass through a living membrane, and that checkpoint lets the root control what reaches the xylem.

